Subject: [PATCH 22/32] perf/arm-dmc620: Assign parents for event_source device
Date:   Tue, 4 Apr 2023 14:42:15 +0100
Message-ID: <20230404134225.13408-23-Jonathan.Cameron@huawei.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.37.2
